    "narrowControlMinHeight": 44,
    "touchControlMinWidth": 44,
    "rule": "Density is chosen per component class, not per application. Repeated-use rows, toolbars and trees default to Compact. Forms, dialogs and primary navigation default to Comfortable. Touch applies when the input is touch."
